          "Monitor whether the 31% opposition is growing among younger residents or those frustrated with property tax burden or service decline; a shift of three to four percentage points from older homeowners experiencing economic stress or from tribal communities mobilized on healthcare access could narrow the margin materially, so treat constituent engagement as continuous rather than assuming the current margin is floor."
