          "Recognize the 4.8% demographic gap as a present constituency, not a statistical artifact: the Native American residents represented in that gap include Passamaquoddy, Penobscot, and Maliseet citizens whose civic infrastructure and voting participation have historically influenced Maine elections; active engagement on tribal healthcare access, sovereignty recognition, and economic development is both constituent service and electoral insurance.",
