          "Do not allow the absence of a 2024 opponent to become an assumption of permanent safety: unopposed races frequently precede competitive cycles when demographic or economic conditions shift or when a challenger emerges with authentic community credibility; maintaining active constituent service and relationship-building with homeowner and tribal communities is the foundation for retaining this seat if contestation returns."
