          "Lead with aging-in-place healthcare infrastructure and property tax fairness for older homeowners: at 49.5-year median age and $90,973 income, HD-19 is a constituency of asset-holding retirees and near-retirees whose material concerns center on Medicare access, rural hospital viability, and property tax sustainability on fixed incomes—not abstract ideology.",
          "Engage the 2.88% demographic gap with specificity and authenticity: whether immigrant communities, multiracial households, or Native American residents, this swing constituency of 900–1,200 people is invisible in the Census percentages but consequential in a close election; genuine constituent service and policy engagement here is both a governance obligation and an electoral insurance policy.",
