          "Recognize that 35.8% college attainment and $43,563 income mean this constituency is not positioned to weather economic shocks through credential-based mobility or asset accumulation — infrastructure, healthcare systems, and wage-supporting employers are the material determinants of quality of life, and legislative focus on these material foundations is both good governance and good politics."
