          "Deliver measurable property tax fairness—an educated, property-holding constituency at $79,738 income is acutely aware of tax burden relative to services received; specific proposals on assessment reform, circuit breaker programs for seniors, or commercial property contribution rebalancing build constituent confidence that government is stewarding their wealth, not confiscating it.",
          "Engage the 5.5% Hispanic and 2.57% Asian communities with programmatic specificity beyond symbolic acknowledgment—economic mobility, workforce development, and healthcare access are the material concerns of immigrant and minority communities in affluent districts, and a representative who addresses these directly builds loyalty across demographic lines while strengthening the seat's Democratic floor."
