          "Engage AIAN communities specifically despite their small size: the ~1.2% demographic gap likely represents Native American residents whose governance needs around tribal sovereignty, healthcare access, and economic development can become invisible in a district this homogeneous. Authentic engagement—not token acknowledgment—builds durability in a coalition that is otherwise so demographically tight that even small shifts in constituent perception can shift outcomes.",
