          "Avoid treating an unopposed 2024 victory as evidence of durable support; understand specifically what economic pressures or governance failures might activate a challenger in the next cycle, and address those vulnerabilities before opposition emerges rather than after.",
          "Build constituent service visibility on rural infrastructure, healthcare access, and tax fairness—the concrete governance deliverables that matter to a working-class homeowner constituency in a state where these issues are salient and where demonstrable results build political durability.",
          "Monitor the ~5.3% demographic gap for organizing capacity; while unlikely to reshape the district's character, any latent constituency—American Indian residents, immigrant communities, or others—represents both a governance obligation and a potential vulnerability if opposition campaigns target these communities while the incumbent neglects them."
