          "Treat the 69% as a consolidated base requiring active maintenance, not an expanding coalition — the incumbent's strategic task is delivering on the specific governance commitments (school funding, property tax fairness, environmental protection, neighborhood quality) that keep affluent, college-educated homeowners engaged with Democratic governance, not pursuing marginal gains among the 31% Republican minority.",
