          "Consolidate the homeowner majority through fiscal responsibility and tax fairness: at 78.7% homeownership and $105,112 income, property tax burden, municipal service delivery, and transparent budget management are the tangible governance issues that determine whether constituents perceive the incumbent as competent. Any perception of wasteful spending or fiscal mismanagement will erode the margin faster than Republican opposition can.",
