          "Build a specific working-class economic security agenda around wages, childcare, and healthcare access: at 37.0 median age and 18.4% college attainment, the district's workforce is employed in trades and service sectors where wage stagnation, childcare costs, and healthcare affordability are the material constraints on economic mobility; a representative who legislates on these specifics rather than abstract values will demonstrate relevance.",
