          "Defend education funding and quality as a core working-family investment: the 37.2% college-attainment rate signals a constituency that values education as a pathway to economic mobility; school funding, student debt relief, and workforce development programs are the concrete ways a Democratic candidate demonstrates commitment to the district's economic future.",
