          "Do not take college-educated voters for granted: the 39.8% college attainment is a strength, but college-educated homeowners and renters at $72,269 income are evaluating on fiscal management and whether government is delivering concrete value — ideological alignment is necessary but insufficient if taxes are rising and services are declining.",
